      "publicationStatus": "reviewed",
      "statementKind": "definition",
      "text": "The Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy describes imperialism in terms of political and economic control over dependent territory; that territorial relation is distinct from whether a polity's head of state is a monarch.",
